OK, first: What does a potion that displays:
"Wow! This makes you feel good!" do?
And what about a scroll that says:
"You hear maniacal laughter in the distance."
Oh, yes, and what about when you "feel a chill" after doing whatever...

Also: Kei the Valkyrie happened to be sacrificing a werejackal to Loki
the other day, and not only was the altar covered with blood but I managed
to summon a demon. The demon was peaceful and didn't seem to do much other
than wander around. Is there anything you're supposed to do with these
guys when they DO show up? (I tried #chat, no luck...)

Now the suggestion: This was one of my favorite things from Rogue and I
wish it was implemented in Nethack. You could hit a key and see a list
of all the things you've discovered over the course of the game. (For
example, "A red potion of booze... a puce potion of gain ability...
a scroll called HACKEM MUCHE of identify" etc.) Absolutely useless, of
course, but it was still sort of neat. Anyone else think this should
be added?

